'''Drakuu''' is an [[NPC]] in {{Zone|The Wasteland}} that sells the {{Item|Kuudra Follower Artifact}} and gives out the {{Item|Kuudra Teeth Plaque}}. They only appear after defeating [[Kuudra]] once.

== Purpose ==
'''Drakuu''' will open a shop menu to players wearing [[Kuudra Follower Armor]] during a {{Volcano Activity|Cataclysmic}} eruption from the {{Zone|Blazing Volcano}}. In it, he sells the {{Item|Kuudra Follower Artifact}} for {{Coins|100m}}, {{Item|Enchanted Red Sand|amount=1,024}}, {{Item|Enchanted Mycelium|amount=1,024}}, and {{Item|Kuudra Teeth|amount=64}}.

He will also give out the {{Item|Exquisite Kuudra Teeth Plaque}} to players wearing full [[Kuudra Follower Armor]] in exchange for a {{Item|Golden Ball}}. This can be used to upgrade the artifact to the {{Item|Kuudra Follower Relic}}, and unlock the ability to obtain the {{Item|Kuudra Mandible}} from [[Kuudra#Loot|Kuudra Loot]].

